WHAT THIS PROJECT IS FOR

This is a demonstration and a teaching artifact. It exists to show what an AI
agent can and cannot do inside a real Godot workflow, and it is published so the
code and the process can be read, studied and argued with.

It is not a product. It is not maintained as a game, it takes no feature
requests, and it is not intended to be shipped as one. The licence is MIT
because the point is for people to learn from this and reuse the techniques
freely. Treat it as a worked example rather than a dependency.
